WEBVTT

1
00:00:06,320 --> 00:00:25,470
Are you weird? Lin Feng

2
00:00:26,100 --> 00:00:27,500
We are all hot and cold

3
00:00:27,700 --> 00:00:28,900
It's hard to find here

4
00:00:29,300 --> 00:00:30,900
Just eat poisonous food here by yourself

5
00:00:31,300 --> 00:00:37,060
Why are you so selfish?

6
00:00:37,460 --> 00:00:40,240
Everyone is hungry

7
00:00:40,280 --> 00:00:42,080
You drove me out of the camp during the day

8
00:00:42,480 --> 00:00:44,910
Have you ever thought about my life and death?

9
00:00:45,770 --> 00:00:47,170
Why didn't you think about it then?

10
00:00:47,370 --> 00:00:49,110
Are you selfish?

11
00:00:50,930 --> 00:00:53,330
Now you still have the nerve to come and question me.

12
00:00:53,530 --> 00:00:54,730
We are girls after all

13
00:00:54,930 --> 00:00:57,490
It's just self-protection Lin Feng

14
00:00:57,890 --> 00:00:59,290
We're not here to quarrel

15
00:00:59,690 --> 00:01:01,490
Everyone is really cold and hungry

16
00:01:01,890 --> 00:01:02,890
your food

17
00:01:03,090 --> 00:01:04,490
Can you share some with everyone?

18
00:01:05,850 --> 00:01:06,850
Miss Chen

19
00:01:07,050 --> 00:01:08,250
My memory is not very good

20
00:01:08,450 --> 00:01:09,650
You help me recall memories

21
00:01:10,250 --> 00:01:12,650
Who proposed the compromise case during the day?

22
00:01:12,850 --> 00:01:13,850
Let me be a cow or a horse

23
00:01:14,050 --> 00:01:15,050
Go sleep in the corner

24
00:01:17,460 --> 00:01:21,460
Who said that I was hiding my love for safety and incited everyone to vote to kick me out?

25
00:01:21,660 --> 00:01:25,580
That's for everyone's safety.

26
00:01:26,140 --> 00:01:27,140
for safety

27
00:01:28,640 --> 00:01:30,040
You raise your hands to protect me from this safety hazard

28
00:01:30,240 --> 00:01:31,420
drove away

29
00:01:31,420 --> 00:01:32,420
Now he comes to me again

30
00:01:32,620 --> 00:01:36,850
Why don't you come in front of me to beg for food?

31
00:01:37,250 --> 00:01:38,650
My safe and secure identity

32
00:01:39,250 --> 00:01:44,430
It depends on whether you are hungry or not.

33
00:01:48,940 --> 00:01:49,940
Brother Lin Feng

34
00:01:50,540 --> 00:01:52,340
What happened before was that we were wrong

35
00:01:52,940 --> 00:01:55,260
Not apologizing to you

36
00:01:55,460 --> 00:01:56,860
Can I give you something to eat?

37
00:01:58,300 --> 00:02:08,100
I'm really hungry. Get out of here. Get out of here.

38
00:02:08,900 --> 00:02:10,100
Why are you pretending to be cute in front of me?

39
00:02:10,860 --> 00:02:11,860
Cute enough to eat

40
00:02:15,500 --> 00:02:16,900
We don't want your food in vain either.

41
00:02:19,520 --> 00:02:20,920
I can exchange things with you

42
00:02:30,290 --> 00:02:31,290
I'd like to see it

43
00:02:33,540 --> 00:02:34,540
What would you give in exchange?
